  "summary": {
    "text": "Morgan Hall North is a 27-floor residential tower at 1601 N Broad St in Philadelphia, part of Temple University's three-building Mitchell and Hilarie Morgan Hall complex, which houses about 1,275 students. It was designed by MGA Partners and built with L.F. Driscoll as construction manager and Aegis Property Group as project manager. Construction was completed in 2013, and Temple still lists it as an active residence hall.",
